{"4340120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ninja Soldier Raid", "steam_appid": 4340120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Soldier. One Jungle. Thousands of Ninjas.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Ninja Soldier Raid</strong>, the silence of the forest is broken only by gunfire and the clashing of steel. You play as a specialized operative caught behind enemy lines in a territory ruled by a secret order of shinobi. This isn't a stealth mission—it's an all-out war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a perfect blend of classic arcade run-and-gun mechanics and modern tactical platforming. The ninjas are fast, but your lead is faster.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Soldier. One Jungle. Thousands of Ninjas.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Ninja Soldier Raid</strong>, the silence of the forest is broken only by gunfire and the clashing of steel. You play as a specialized operative caught behind enemy lines in a territory ruled by a secret order of shinobi. This isn't a stealth mission—it's an all-out war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a perfect blend of classic arcade run-and-gun mechanics and modern tactical platforming. The ninjas are fast, but your lead is faster.</p>", "short_description": "Modern firepower meets ancient shadows! Ninja Soldier Raid is a 2D side-scrolling action platformer. As an elite soldier in a deadly jungle, outgun waves of lethal ninja clans. Lock, load, and survive a high-octane battle where every bullet counts and every shadow hides a blade.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4340120/7015f0a293f149d5bab6350665094e0a087db572/header.jpg?t=1776001237", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/